<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss launch three-month money market claims.</title>
<headline>Swiss launch three-month money market claims.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Swiss federal government is issuing three-month money market claims to be paid for on July 10, the Swiss National Bank said.</p>
<p>The allocation of series 3.394 claims follows the end of subscriptions on July 8.</p>
<p>The previous issue of three-month claims, paid for on July 3, raised 736.60 million francs and was priced at 99.677 percent to yield 1.282 percent annually.</p>
<p>-- Zurich editorial, +41 1 258 7340</p>
</text>
